                                "sense_id": "504b45d2-0c9e-34ef-8f67-277cc4b0b9e0",
                                "text": "Ze is hoogleraar in de rechten aan de Universiteit van Amsterdam.",
                                "translation": "She is a professor of law at the University of Amsterdam.",
